    "text": "Her sutela\u00f0 hu Alfric arcebisceop his cwyde gedihte.\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00e6rest him to saulsceate he becw\u00e6\u00f0 into cristes cyrcan \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Wyllan & \u00e6t Burnan &\nAnd he becwa\u00f0 his laford his beste scip & \u00fea segelger\u00e6da \u00f0arto & LX healma & LX beornena.\n& he wilnode gif hit his lafordes willa w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t he gefaestnode into sancte Albane \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t\nAn he becw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Dumeltun into Abbandune & \u00c6lfno\u00f0e \u00f0arof III hida his d\u00e6g and su\u00f0\u00f0an to\n& X oxan & II men he him becw\u00e6\u00f0 & filgan hi \u00feam lafordscype \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00fe\u00e6t land to hyre.\nAnd he cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Wealingaforda \u00fee he gebohte Celew\u00e6rde & hofer his d\u00e6g into Ceolesige.\n& he becw\u00e6\u00f0 into sancte Albane \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Tiwan & standan \u00fea forword betweonan \u00fean abbode &\n& heora forewyrd w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t Osanig \u00e6fter Ceolrices d\u00e6ge gange eac \u00feyderin.\n& \u00fe\u00e6t land on Lundene \u00fee he mid his feo gebohte he becw\u00e6\u00f0 into sancte Alb\u00e6ne & his bec ealle he\nAnd he becw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t man fenge on \u00fee feoh \u00f0e man h\u00e6fde & \u00e6rest \u00e6lcne borh agulde & su\u00f0\u00f0an tilode to\nAnd anes scipes he geu\u00f0e \u00feam folce to Cent & o\u00feres to Wiltunescire.\n& elles on o\u00f0rum \u00feingum gif \u00fe\u00e6s hw\u00e6t w\u00e6re he b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t Uulfstan bisceop & Leofric abbud dihton swa\nAnd \u00fee land be westan \u00e6t Fittingtune & \u00e6t Niwantune he becw\u00e6\u00f0 his sweostrun & heora beornun.\n& \u00c6lfheages land Esnes suna ga a on his cyn.\nAnd he becw\u00e6\u00f0 Uulfstane \u00e6rcebiscope ane sweorrode & anne ring & anne psaltere & Alfheage biscope\nAnd he forgeaf on Godes est Centingan \u00fe\u00e6ne borh \u00fee hy hym sceoldan & Middelsexon & Su\u00f0rion \u00fe\u0